  "summary_en": "German federal ordinance (Bundesrat Drucksache 39/17) amending aviation rules for unmanned aircraft and model aircraft. It equalises treatment of hobby and commercial drones on a risk basis, adding labelling above 0.25 kg, knowledge certificates above 2 kg, permits above 5 kg, and operating bans over sensitive areas.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Name-and-address labelling mandatory for drones and model aircraft over 0.25 kg",
   "Proof of knowledge (certificate, valid 5 years) required for operators of devices over 2 kg, except on model airfields",
   "Permit required above 5 kg, at night, near airfields; operation above 25 kg banned with exceptions",
   "Operating bans over crowds, critical infrastructure, residential plots with cameras, above 100 m, and in control zones",
   "Luftfahrt-Bundesamt recognises and supervises certifying bodies; fines for violations"
  ],
